{
  "file": "module2",
  "page": 49,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        105.54802703857422,
        471.33013916015625,
        147.1480255126953
      ],
      "text": "4. Monitoring and evaluation",
      "font": "SegoeUI",
      "size": 32.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        180.51710510253906,
        527.5711669921875,
        194.96009826660156
      ],
      "text": "In this section, we consider the monitoring and evaluation required to support the implementation of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.990045547485352,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        193.7171173095703,
        527.3980102539062,
        208.1601104736328
      ],
      "text": "TB screening programmes. The operational handbook contains more details about the monitoring,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        204.1231231689453,
        347.8515930175781,
        221.36012268066406
      ],
      "text": "(7) surveillance and evaluation of TB screening interventions .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        228.6210479736328,
        527.40673828125,
        243.0640411376953
      ],
      "text": "When considering implementing screening in the general population, it is important to know the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        241.8209991455078,
        527.1217041015625,
        256.2640075683594
      ],
      "text": "epidemiology of TB and the prevalence of undetected TB in the community. This will help to estimate",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.995599746704102,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        255.02113342285156,
        527.2979125976562,
        269.4641418457031
      ],
      "text": "the impact of any screening programme. TB disease prevalence surveys are used to assess the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        265.4271240234375,
        527.4312744140625,
        282.6641540527344
      ],
      "text": "(81) baseline occurrence of TB in high-burden settings  . However, these surveys represent a major",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        281.4210205078125,
        527.3970947265625,
        295.8640441894531
      ],
      "text": "undertaking and are not practical in all situations. Surveillance data based on TB notifications can be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        294.62103271484375,
        527.2434692382812,
        309.0640563964844
      ],
      "text": "used as a starting point, but it must be carefully considered alongside other factors that affect the risk",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.98784351348877,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        307.82098388671875,
        527.4334106445312,
        322.2640075683594
      ],
      "text": "of TB and the likelihood of diagnosis, including the availability of health services and the prevalence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        321.0211181640625,
        527.384765625,
        335.4641418457031
      ],
      "text": "of other risk factors for TB (e.g. HIV, diabetes mellitus, smoking, malnutrition, poverty, overcrowded",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        334.22100830078125,
        527.3937377929688,
        348.6640319824219
      ],
      "text": "living conditions, older age, substance use disorder, and other lung conditions, including silicosis or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        347.4210205078125,
        171.4072265625,
        361.8640441894531
      ],
      "text": "fibrotic chest lesions).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        369.125,
        527.35205078125,
        383.5680236816406
      ],
      "text": "In settings that are generally considered to have a higher TB burden than is found in the overall",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        382.32501220703125,
        527.1171875,
        396.7680358886719
      ],
      "text": "population, such as prisons, careful monitoring and surveillance to assess TB prevalence and incidence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.962737083435059,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        395.5249938964844,
        527.3981323242188,
        409.968017578125
      ],
      "text": "should be done alongside TB screening. If the burden of TB is found to be low and sustained at a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        408.7250061035156,
        527.3672485351562,
        423.16802978515625
      ],
      "text": "low level for a period of time, then TB screening can be discontinued. However, surveillance should",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        421.9250183105469,
        376.9742126464844,
        436.3680419921875
      ],
      "text": "be conducted to minimize the risks of TB disease and transmission.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        450.356201171875,
        186.1409454345703,
        475.1512145996094
      ],
      "text": "4.1 Indicators",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        480.60211181640625,
        527.4201049804688,
        495.0451354980469
      ],
      "text": "Continued monitoring can help programme managers assess the performance of the TB screening",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        493.8020935058594,
        527.3793334960938,
        508.2451171875
      ],
      "text": "components that are within their purview. The following indicators should be considered for each",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        507.002197265625,
        160.96681213378906,
        521.4451904296875
      ],
      "text": "targeted risk group:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        528.7061157226562,
        288.1653137207031,
        543.1491088867188
      ],
      "text": "1.\t the number of people eligible for screening;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        546.1580200195312,
        527.4282836914062,
        560.6010131835938
      ],
      "text": "2.\t the number of people screened (considering the first screening and second screening separately,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        559.3580932617188,
        147.26589965820312,
        573.8010864257812
      ],
      "text": "if applicable);",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        576.8101196289062,
        386.8468933105469,
        591.2531127929688
      ],
      "text": "3.\t the proportion of those eligible for screening who were screened;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        594.2620239257812,
        378.9065246582031,
        608.7050170898438
      ],
      "text": "4.\t the number of people with presumptive TB who were identified;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        611.7139892578125,
        356.9364013671875,
        626.156982421875
      ],
      "text": "5.\t the number of people undergoing diagnostic investigation;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        629.1658935546875,
        385.7959899902344,
        643.60888671875
      ],
      "text": "6.\t the number of people diagnosed with TB, stratified by type of TB;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        646.617919921875,
        425.8536071777344,
        661.0609130859375
      ],
      "text": "7.\t the proportion of those undergoing diagnostic investigation who have TB;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        664.0698852539062,
        264.14068603515625,
        678.5128784179688
      ],
      "text": "8.\t the NNS to detect one person with TB;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        681.5217895507812,
        527.3919067382812,
        695.9647827148438
      ],
      "text": "9.\t the proportion of initial defaulters (that is, the number of people diagnosed with TB who do NOT",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        694.721923828125,
        384.6708984375,
        709.1649169921875
      ],
      "text": "start treatment divided by number of people diagnosed with TB);",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        712.173828125,
        449.3793640136719,
        726.6168212890625
      ],
      "text": "10.\tthe treatment success rate and the death rate (using standard cohort analyses).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        733.877685546875,
        527.446533203125,
        748.3206787109375
      ],
      "text": "Additional disaggregation may be done – for example, by age group and sex – but this requires that",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        747.0778198242188,
        385.37030029296875,
        761.5208129882812
      ],
      "text": "more detailed data are collected for each individual who is screened.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        427.964111328125,
        801.0170288085938,
        554.0401611328125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "4. Monitoring and evaluation 37",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}